{title: Kitni Baateiin Yaad Aati Hai}
{artist: Hariharan Sadhana Sargam Shankar Ehsaan Loy}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Kit [D]ni baatein yaad [G]aati [Em]hai,        Tas [D]veere si ban [G]jaati [Em]hai
Main [F#m]kaise [Em]inhe bhoo [A]loo,        Dil [D]ko kya [G]samjhaa [Em]oou
Kit [D]ni baatien keh [G]ne ki [Em]hai,        Ho [D]thon par jo seh [G]mi si [Em]hai
Ik [F#m]roz [Em]inhe sun [A]lo,        Kyu [D]aise [G]ghumsum [Em]ho
Kyu [D]poori ho na paayi das [G]taan,        kai [Am]se aayi hai aisi doori [D]yaan
[D]Dono ke dilon me sawaal hai,        [Gm]fir bhi hai khamoshi
to [Gm]kaun hai kiska doshi koi [D]kya kahe,        [D]Kaisi ulzano ki jaal hai
[Gm]jinme uljhe hai dil,        Ab [Gm]hona hai kya haasil koi [D]kyaa kahe
Dil ki [Gm]hai kaisi majboori [D]yaan,        Kho [D]ye the kaise raaho ke ni [G]shan
kai [Am]se aayi hai aisi doori [D]yaan,        [D]Kitni baatein keh [G]ne ki hai
[D]Honton par jo [G]sehmi si hai,        [F#m]Ik roz [Em]inhein [A]sunlo
[D]Kyun aise [G]gum-sum [Em]ho
